# SPA routing
#
# Cloudflare Pages serves /index.html for any path that does not match a static
# asset (verified with `wrangler pages dev`), so deep links like /doctor or
# /chats/<id> work out of the box once the Functions fallback is in place.
#
# That is why this file has no rewrite rule: `/*  /index.html  200` makes
# wrangler log an "infinite loop" warning (it re-matches /index.html itself).
#
# If you later add a top-level `404.html`, Pages stops doing the automatic
# fallback — then uncomment the rule below:
#
# /*    /index.html   200
